{"id":"8e83a214f93c9681","group":"58","path":"58/batch03/58-df-zfc-logic9-interpolation-property.md","title":"ZFC Logic9 Interpolation Property","display":"df-zfc-logic9-interpolation-property — ZFC Logic9 Interpolation Property","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-logic9-interpolation-property","aliases":["58-df-zfc-logic9-interpolation-property"],"display":"df-zfc-logic9-interpolation-property — ZFC Logic9 Interpolation Property","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[58-df-formula]]","[[58-df-logic]]","[[58-df-first-order-language]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-logic9-interpolation-property"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-logic9-interpolation-property</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-logic9-interpolation-property — ZFC Logic9 Interpolation Property"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"65418b505fc53093\" href=\"?note=65418b505fc53093\" title=\"58-df-formula\">58-df-formula</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"44e32f3fb4334e0c\" href=\"?note=44e32f3fb4334e0c\" title=\"58-df-logic\">58-df-logic</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"3888033a846b1cd5\" href=\"?note=3888033a846b1cd5\" title=\"58-df-first-order-language\">58-df-first-order-language</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma,\\varphi,\\psi,\\theta\\in V\">\\(\\Sigma,\\varphi,\\psi,\\theta\\in V\\)</span></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FirstOrderLanguage}_S\\subseteq V\">\\(\\mathrm{FirstOrderLanguage}_S\\subseteq V\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Sent}_S(\\Sigma)\">\\(\\mathrm{Sent}_S(\\Sigma)\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\models_\\Sigma\">\\(\\models_\\Sigma\\)</span> are from the syntax/logic dependencies</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Vocabulary}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(\\Sigma,\\varphi)\">\\(\\operatorname{Vocabulary}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(\\Sigma,\\varphi)\\)</span> 为下式定义的非逻辑符号集合。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcLogic9InterpolationProperty}_S:V\\to\\mathsf{Bool}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcLogic9InterpolationProperty}_S:V\\to\\mathsf{Bool}\\)</span> 为下式定义的集合论谓词</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a,b,S\\in V\">\\(a,b,S\\in V\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FormulaVocabularyRecursion}_{58}\">\\(\\mathrm{FormulaVocabularyRecursion}_{58}\\)</span> 为下式定义的递归图谓词。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f(\\vec t)\">\\(f(\\vec t)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"r(\\vec t)\">\\(r(\\vec t)\\)</span> 使用源文件的有限元组构造子；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Vocabulary}_{\\mathsf{meta}}\">\\(\\operatorname{Vocabulary}_{\\mathsf{meta}}\\)</span> 的下标保留，值由下式唯一确定。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>外部接口 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Cst}\">\\(\\mathrm{Cst}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Fun}\">\\(\\mathrm{Fun}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Symbols}\">\\(\\mathrm{Symbols}\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"3888033a846b1cd5\" href=\"?note=3888033a846b1cd5\" title=\"58-df-first-order-language\">58-df-first-order-language</a> 的同名定义与参数次序。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>外部接口 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Trm}\">\\(\\mathrm{Trm}\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"65418b505fc53093\" href=\"?note=65418b505fc53093\" title=\"58-df-formula\">58-df-formula</a> 的同名定义与参数次序。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}logic9\\text{-}interpolation\\text{-}property}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcLogic9InterpolationProperty}_S(\\Sigma)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{FirstOrderLanguage}_S(\\Sigma)\\land\n\\forall\\varphi,\\psi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_S(\\Sigma)\\;\\Bigl(\n\\{\\varphi\\}\\models_\\Sigma\\psi\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\to\\exists\\theta\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_S(\\Sigma)\\;\\Bigl(\n\\operatorname{Vocabulary}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(\\Sigma,\\theta)\n\\subseteq\\operatorname{Vocabulary}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(\\Sigma,\\varphi)\n\\cap\\operatorname{Vocabulary}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(\\Sigma,\\psi)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{13em}\\land\\{\\varphi\\}\\models_\\Sigma\\theta\n\\land\\{\\theta\\}\\models_\\Sigma\\psi\n\\Bigr)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}logic9\\text{-}interpolation\\text{-}property}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcLogic9InterpolationProperty}_S(\\Sigma)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{FirstOrderLanguage}_S(\\Sigma)\\land\n\\forall\\varphi,\\psi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_S(\\Sigma)\\;\\Bigl(\n\\{\\varphi\\}\\models_\\Sigma\\psi\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\to\\exists\\theta\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_S(\\Sigma)\\;\\Bigl(\n\\operatorname{Vocabulary}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(\\Sigma,\\theta)\n\\subseteq\\operatorname{Vocabulary}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(\\Sigma,\\varphi)\n\\cap\\operatorname{Vocabulary}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(\\Sigma,\\psi)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{13em}\\land\\{\\varphi\\}\\models_\\Sigma\\theta\n\\land\\{\\theta\\}\\models_\\Sigma\\psi\n\\Bigr)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{FormulaVocabularyRecursion}_{58}(a,b,\\Sigma)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{FirstOrderLanguage}_S(\\Sigma)\\land\n\\mathrm{Function}(a,\\mathrm{Trm}_S(\\Sigma),\\mathcal P(\\mathrm{Symbols}_S(\\Sigma)))\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{Function}(b,\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\Sigma),\\mathcal P(\\mathrm{Symbols}_S(\\Sigma)))\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall x\\in\\mathrm{Var}_S\\;a(x)=\\varnothing\n\\land\\forall c\\in\\Sigma.\\mathrm{Cst}\\;a(c)=\\{c\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\\forall f\\in\\Sigma.\\mathrm{Fun}_n\\;\\forall\\vec t\\in\\mathrm{Trm}_S(\\Sigma)^n\\;\na(f(\\vec t))=\\{f\\}\\cup\\bigcup_{i\\in n}a(\\vec t(i))\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall t,u\\in\\mathrm{Trm}_S(\\Sigma)\\;b(t\\doteq u)=a(t)\\cup a(u)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\\forall r\\in\\Sigma.\\mathrm{Rel}_n\\;\\forall\\vec t\\in\\mathrm{Trm}_S(\\Sigma)^n\\;\nb(r(\\vec t))=\\{r\\}\\cup\\bigcup_{i\\in n}a(\\vec t(i))\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall\\varphi,\\psi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\Sigma)\\;\\forall x\\in\\mathrm{Var}_S\\;\n\\bigl(b(\\neg\\varphi)=b(\\varphi)\\land b(\\varphi\\lor\\psi)=b(\\varphi)\\cup b(\\psi)\n\\land b(\\forall x\\,\\varphi)=b(\\varphi)\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{FormulaVocabularyRecursion}_{58}(a,b,\\Sigma)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{FirstOrderLanguage}_S(\\Sigma)\\land\n\\mathrm{Function}(a,\\mathrm{Trm}_S(\\Sigma),\\mathcal P(\\mathrm{Symbols}_S(\\Sigma)))\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{Function}(b,\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\Sigma),\\mathcal P(\\mathrm{Symbols}_S(\\Sigma)))\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall x\\in\\mathrm{Var}_S\\;a(x)=\\varnothing\n\\land\\forall c\\in\\Sigma.\\mathrm{Cst}\\;a(c)=\\{c\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\\forall f\\in\\Sigma.\\mathrm{Fun}_n\\;\\forall\\vec t\\in\\mathrm{Trm}_S(\\Sigma)^n\\;\na(f(\\vec t))=\\{f\\}\\cup\\bigcup_{i\\in n}a(\\vec t(i))\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall t,u\\in\\mathrm{Trm}_S(\\Sigma)\\;b(t\\doteq u)=a(t)\\cup a(u)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\\forall r\\in\\Sigma.\\mathrm{Rel}_n\\;\\forall\\vec t\\in\\mathrm{Trm}_S(\\Sigma)^n\\;\nb(r(\\vec t))=\\{r\\}\\cup\\bigcup_{i\\in n}a(\\vec t(i))\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall\\varphi,\\psi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\Sigma)\\;\\forall x\\in\\mathrm{Var}_S\\;\n\\bigl(b(\\neg\\varphi)=b(\\varphi)\\land b(\\varphi\\lor\\psi)=b(\\varphi)\\cup b(\\psi)\n\\land b(\\forall x\\,\\varphi)=b(\\varphi)\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{FirstOrderLanguage}_S(\\Sigma)\\land\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\Sigma)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\to\\Bigl(\\operatorname{Vocabulary}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(\\Sigma,\\varphi)=S\n\\leftrightarrow\\exists a,b\\in V\\;\n(\\mathrm{FormulaVocabularyRecursion}_{58}(a,b,\\Sigma)\\land S=b(\\varphi))\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{FirstOrderLanguage}_S(\\Sigma)\\land\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\Sigma)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\to\\Bigl(\\operatorname{Vocabulary}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(\\Sigma,\\varphi)=S\n\\leftrightarrow\\exists a,b\\in V\\;\n(\\mathrm{FormulaVocabularyRecursion}_{58}(a,b,\\Sigma)\\land S=b(\\varphi))\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>保留原句子插值性质及词汇交条件；词汇函数现在由相同语法上的两个递归函数图确定，不引入新的公式编码。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","loc